[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054100702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3054100702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3054100702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62CeDe","user":{"login":"OptimalFailure","id":54728770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzI4Nzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54728770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure","html_url":"https://github.com/OptimalFailure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T21:25:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T21:25:21Z","body":"Additionally, it seems that add_child is not called when re-loading a scene in the editor, despite new instances of the child nodes being created. (That is, the children after re-opening the scene do not match the previous children saved with the @export_storage annotation)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054100702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054359939","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3054359939","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3054359939,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62DdWD","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T22:56:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T23:38:55Z","body":"> Instead, it is necessary to create a plugin and a custom type to successfully override add_child().\n\nActually, `add_child()` is not overridden, but a method of the same name is created on the script.\n\n~~This issue seems to be a bug in `Callable::call()`.~~ Or it's a bug in the plugin, it's missing a check.\n\nUndo and redo methods are implemented through `Callable`. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/editor/editor_undo_redo_manager.cpp#L157-L160\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/editor/editor_undo_redo_manager.cpp#L162-L165\n\n`Callable.call()` will eventually call `Object::callp()`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/core/variant/callable.cpp#L69\n\n\n`Object::callp()` will first call the method of the same name on the script instance, and then call the method of the same name on the native class.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/core/object/object.cpp#L849-L872\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3054359939/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3056954443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3056954443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3056954443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62NWxL","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T11:04:35Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T11:04:35Z","body":"These methods can indeed not be overridden, see the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#inheritance), this is unsupported behavior and the issue mainly here seems to be a failure to detect this\n\nI haven't checked but the most likely reason is that plugins do not check for errors etc. by default","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3056954443/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059078167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3059078167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3059078167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62VdQX","user":{"login":"OptimalFailure","id":54728770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzI4Nzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54728770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure","html_url":"https://github.com/OptimalFailure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T21:03:52Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T21:03:52Z","body":"Thanks for clarifying. I assume that add_child() is called through GDScript in some scenarios which is why overriding/shadowing it works sporadically? \nIt is unfortunate that this method can't be overridden-- using the \"child_entered_tree\" signal at a substitute means that no operations involving the children will register unless the parent is active in the scene tree. Probably not a common concern but it does make a (small) difference in my case.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059078167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059153544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3059153544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3059153544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62VvqI","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T21:23:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T21:23:58Z","body":"That's something for a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals)\n\nSo let's see if there's some issue here with the discovery\n\nCan you enable errors and warnings in plugins? It's under `debug/gdscript/warnings/exclude_addons` in the project settings ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059153544/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059206943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3059206943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3059206943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62V8sf","user":{"login":"OptimalFailure","id":54728770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzI4Nzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54728770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure","html_url":"https://github.com/OptimalFailure","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OptimalFailure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T21:47:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T22:21:51Z","body":"Yep, that was it! Enabling warnings now gives the same warning in the plugin as I was seeing outside of it. \n~~I created a [discussion ](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/12764)about exposing add_child as virtual but perhaps I should go directly to a proposal.~~ I have created a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12766) here. \nThanks again for your help!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3059206943/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061117566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108419#issuecomment-3061117566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108419","id":3061117566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62dPJ-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T07:59:31Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T07:59:31Z","body":"That's great! Then I'll go ahead and close this!\n\nThank you!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061117566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]